</head>
<body bgcolor="#ffffff" style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 600px; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><tr><td style="font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="600" align="center" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<tr><td style="padding: 24px; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #1f4fd8; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">Hourmere</p>
<p>Ada Lovelace invited you to join the team “Orbital Design” on Hourmere.</p>
<p>Sign in with the invited email address invited+team@example.test and verify it, then accept the invitation on the page. Email aliases cannot replace this address.</p>
<p>Signing in alone does not join the team; you must explicitly accept on the page.</p>
<p>This invitation expires at 2026-10-29 17:30:00 UTC.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width: 100%; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><tr><td style="padding: 16px 0; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width: 100%; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><tr><td bgcolor="#1f4fd8" style="padding: 0; mso-padding-alt: 12px 18px; background-color: #1f4fd8; border: 1px solid #1f4fd8; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; font-family: -apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><a href="https://calendar.example.test/app/join?invitationId=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22" style="display: block; padding: 12px 18px; line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">View and accept invitation</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
<p style="color: #555; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br><a href="https://calendar.example.test/app/join?invitationId=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22" style="color: #1f4fd8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">https://calendar.example.test/app/join?invitationId=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22</a></p>
<p style="margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 16px; color: #555; font-size: 13px;">If you do not recognize this team or do not want to join, you can ignore this email.</p>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</body>
</html>
",
  "sensitive": true,
  "subject": "Invitation to join Orbital Design",
  "text": "Hourmere

Ada Lovelace invited you to join the team “Orbital Design” on Hourmere.

Sign in with the invited email address invited+team@example.test and verify it, then accept the invitation on the page. Email aliases cannot replace this address.

Signing in alone does not join the team; you must explicitly accept on the page.

This invitation expires at 2026-10-29 17:30:00 UTC.

View and accept invitation
https://calendar.example.test/app/join?invitationId=019a278e-3ff2-7a91-8fe0-1846a52d0b22

If you do not recognize this team or do not want to join, you can ignore this email.
",
  "to": "invited+team@example.test",
}
